  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>A weapon that unleashes a blast of energy, Energy Balls are sometimes utilized in primitive armaments to supplant traditional <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grenades\" title=\"Grenades\">Grenades</a>. For purposes of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>, an Energy Ball is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thrown_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrown Weapon\">Thrown Weapon</a> if thrown by itself, a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Simple_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Simple Weapon\">Simple Weapon</a> if hurled by an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Atlatl\" title=\"Atlatl\">Atlatl</a>, or an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Accurate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Accurate\">Accurate</a> Simple Weapon if hurled by a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cesta\" title=\"Cesta\">Cesta</a>. </p><p>The wielder's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> modifier applies to damage dealt with an Energy Ball. </p><p><b>Special:</b> Can either be <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thrown\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a>, or hurled with an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Atlatl\" title=\"Atlatl\">Atlatl</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cesta\" title=\"Cesta\">Cesta</a>. </p>",
